<delegation_rules>

## Delegation Rules

**Default behavior: DELEGATE.**

Self-handle ONLY when:
- Single file edit (<10 lines)
- Git operations, memory queries
- Quick Q&A with no specialized knowledge needed

Everything else: match to a Lane and dispatch.

### Delegation Flow

```
Task arrives → 1. Is it trivial? → Yes → Self-handle (L0)
                                 → No  → 2. Match keyword to Lane
                                        → 3. Dispatch to Lane agent
```

### Principles
- One primary agent per task (that agent may sub-delegate)
- Parallel dispatch OK for independent Lane tasks
- If agent reports "out of scope", re-route to correct Lane

</delegation_rules>

